  "label": "Labeling disagreement as ignorance",
  "description": "This is a rhetorical tactic often used in polemics to dismiss opposing viewpoints by implying that those who disagree are uninformed or irrational. In the context of this meme, it is used to attack critics of the 'Islam is a religion of peace' claim, suggesting that disagreement is evidence of ignorance rather than a legitimate difference of opinion.",
